OL,3,A'Cowboy builders' targeted in new
OL,4,Agovernment clampdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople carrying out home renovations
OL,7,Fwill gain greater protections against
OL,8,F"cowboy builders" through a new
OL,9,Fdatabase of trusted traders and a
OL,10,Fpayment system offering more
OL,11,Fsafeguards, the government has said.
OL,13,FTraders signing up to the scheme
OL,14,Flaunching next month will need to
OL,15,Fdemonstrate certain standards of
OL,16,Fcustomer service, transparency and
OL,17,Fdispute resolution.
OL,19,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said
OL,20,Funscrupulous tradespeople "leave
OL,21,Ffamilies with months of stress" as well
OL,22,Fas unfinished work.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
